[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5371415212","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672#issuecomment-5371415212","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672","id":5371415212,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQClKrA","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T14:45:04Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T14:45:04Z","body":"Attaching inner scripts to Nodes isn't supported in the editor UI, so I don't think we need to support opening them.\r\nAnd I don't really like adding this GDScript specific code everywhere.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5371415212/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372082603","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672#issuecomment-5372082603","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672","id":5372082603,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQDN5qw","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T15:45:42Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T15:46:44Z","body":"> Attaching inner scripts to Nodes isn't supported in the editor UI, so I don't think we need to support opening them. And I don't really like adding this GDScript specific code everywhere.\r\n\r\nThe inner class should be handled some way, either by this implementation or by blocking set_script/add_child in the tools script; otherwise, the scene becomes broken when using the tool script and inner classes\r\nThis is a bug and needs to be addressed","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372082603/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372373622","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672#issuecomment-5372373622","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672","id":5372373622,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQDfqdg","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-21T16:13:22Z","updated_at":"2026-08-21T16:13:22Z","body":"Yeah inner classes have limits that we do not probably enforce through errors. \n\nAdding editor support where other parts of the engine don't support them isn't the way to go about it though. Neither is breaking architectural boundaries and plastering gdscript includes all over the place.\n\nBlocking set_script makes zero sense, since inner classes that are programmatically added to the scene tree for e.g. plugin purposes work fine.\n\nA solution to this needs to add proper checks against them (or support for them, but that's not trivial) to the systems that have issues with inner classes. First and foremost that's serialization. And ideally that'd work through some generalized API for resources to opt out of the general purpose resource format and not tech debt includes.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5372373622/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5543571269","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122672#issuecomment-5543571269","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122672","id":5543571269,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABSmwvRQ","user":{"login":"DexterFstone","id":92402263,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYHyVw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92402263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone","html_url":"https://github.com/DexterFstone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DexterFstone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-04T16:34:48Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T16:34:48Z","body":"rebase","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5543571269/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url"